  "releaseNotes": "'## [15.0.0-prerelease.5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v15.0.0-prerelease.4...v15.0.0-prerelease.5) (2026-11-27)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* See the [migration guide](https://dotnet.github.io/dotnet-operator-sdk/docs/operator/migration#upgrading-from-v14-to-v15) for upgrading from v14 to v15.\n* **client:** write the status with server-side apply (#1354)\n\n### Features\n\n* **client:** write the status with server-side apply ([#1354](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1354)) ([af55fb8](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/af55fb81fd4e61e6e9453b70826650c0b5bd9f3c)), closes [#1351](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1351) [#1348](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1348)\n'",
